                                                "example_id": "da0e630f-4278-41ff-a10e-79a77626e4a1",
                                                "sense_id": "588d32e1-1442-3df3-93bc-35471d55076e",
                                                "text": "So Satan fell; and ſtrait a fiery Globe / Of Angels on full ſail of wing flew nigh, / Who on their plumy Vans receiv'd him ſoft […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba6a7dac-0202-485c-97d3-8fd0b35bc7fc",
                                                "sense_id": "588d32e1-1442-3df3-93bc-35471d55076e",
                                                "text": "He wheeled in air, and stretched his vans in vain; / His vans no longer could his flight sustain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d27f0cd-692b-48a2-bde8-47f5ba9fd666",
                                                "sense_id": "588d32e1-1442-3df3-93bc-35471d55076e",
                                                "text": "Because these wings are no longer wings to fly / But merely vans to beat the air[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
